  'Toluene is oxidised with alkaline KMnO4 and acidified to give A; A is treated with SOCl2 to give B; B reacts with NH3 to give C. C is|benzamide|benzonitrile|aniline|phenylethanamide|3|A is benzoic acid; B is benzoyl chloride; C is C<sub>6</sub>H<sub>5</sub>CONH<sub>2</sub>.',
